Lower values are better. AIC and BIC often agree, but BIC penalizes complexity more heavily and may
favor a simpler model. When they disagree, AIC is oriented toward prediction accuracy while BIC
favors the most parsimonious model that explains the data.

### Summarizing with tidy and glance

